{"success":true,"site":"tmdb","sid":"10681","tmdb_id":"movie/10681","media_type":"movie","title":"机器人总动员","original_title":"WALL·E","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eVcHArmmMXajXaqVBH4dhUWfwmS.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYs4ZwnJBK4AgljhvzwNz7fpr3E.jpg","overview":"公元2805年，地球因严重的环境污染和堆积如山的垃圾早已不再适合人类居住，人类乘坐巨型飞船离开家园，只留下大批垃圾清理机器人继续工作。数百年过去，大多数机器人陆续损坏，只有一台名叫瓦力（WALL·E）的机器人仍然日复一日地清理着这颗荒废的星球。漫长的孤独生活让瓦力逐渐拥有了自己的个性，他喜欢收集人类遗留下来的各种小物件，观看古老的歌舞电影，身边还有一只蟑螂作伴。直到某天，一艘飞船突然降临地球，带来了一台名叫伊芙的先进探测机器人。伊芙肩负着寻找植物生命的任务，而瓦力则被这位陌生的访客深深吸引。两个机器人之间的相遇，也让瓦力平静而重复的生活发生了改变，并将他带向一场意想不到的太空冒险……","release_date":"2008-06-26","first_air_date":"","year":"2008","runtime":"98","episode_run_time":"","number_of_episodes":0,"number_of_seasons":0,"genres":["动画","家庭","科幻"],"languages":["English"],"countries":["United States of America"],"tmdb_rating":"8.1 / 10 from 21236 users","tmdb_rating_average":8.129,"tmdb_votes":21236,"imdb_id":"tt0910970","imdb_link":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0910970/","imdb_rating":"8.4 / 10 from 1351054 users","imdb_rating_average":"8.4","imdb_votes":"1351054","directors":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":7,"known_for_department":"Writing","name":"安德鲁·斯坦顿","original_name":"Andrew Stanton","popularity":1.9031,"profile_path":"/fo6ePCWEVB0L1sccrvB99Iaoqcg.jpg","credit_id":"52fe43a29251416c750180d1","department":"Directing","job":"Director"}],"producers":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":72752,"known_for_department":"Production","name":"Jim Morris","original_name":"Jim Morris","popularity":0.2617,"profile_path":"/5HFLUU1oz0cxG0iIrBl1H6CZcwX.jpg","credit_id":"52fe43a29251416c750180dd","department":"Production","job":"Producer"},{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":72753,"known_for_department":"Production","name":"Lindsey Collins","original_name":"Lindsey Collins","popularity":0.5601,"profile_path":"/j8GZqzfI8VvUDQLq2LT5zuLeaX7.jpg","credit_id":"52fe43a29251416c750180e3","department":"Production","job":"Producer"}],"writers":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":15020,"known_for